{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/scale-and-slay_titelDescriptionA.png?t=1749853969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partake in epic battles with giant creatures as you attempt to defy the impossible against bosses of all different types, sizes and abilities. Can you make it through?<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/scaleAndFightBoss_steamPageGif-v3.gif?t=1749853969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/Steam_description_title_B.png?t=1749853969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through this journey of self discovery as you slowly unlock different memories in an attempt to unveil more about this mysterious world and your place in it<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/fragmentedMemories.gif?t=1749853969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/Steam_description_title_C.png?t=1749853969\" /></div>Explore a world of secrets and ancient wonders as you unravel the truth about your estranged father in a personal, intimate story written by an indie developer <br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/playerAndCharacterMeet.gif?t=1749853969\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/Steam_description_title_about-me.png?t=1749853969\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi! I am Jugraaj - an independent developer that occasionally works with contractors on a ramp on/ramp off basis depending on production.<br>--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&gt;Don't forget to wishlist Norigin if you are interested in the game</i><br><i>&gt;Join the discord to become part of our community!</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/wishlist_description_banner-v2.png?t=1749853969\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2135000?t=1749853969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2135000?t=1749853969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/6193c1b6c0fb068dca2c39ee913a56350e2c2f66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749853969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/6193c1b6c0fb068dca2c39ee913a56350e2c2f66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749853969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135000/extras/scale-and-slay_titelDescriptionA.png?t=1749853969\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partake in epic battles with giant creatures as you attempt to defy the impossible against bosses of all different types, sizes and abilities. Can you make it through?<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam